 # Clocks (SystemUI)
+# SystemUIClocks-Flex is not shipped: the retained BD3A prebuilt targets the
+# pre-QPR2 com.android.systemui.plugins.clocks package and bundles its own
+# interface copy, so every QPR2 plugin host rejects it, and SystemUI's default
+# provider already registers DIGITAL_CLOCK_FLEX.
